    {
      "startTime": "2008-10-31T21:30:00Z",
      "endTime": "2008-10-31T22:00:00Z",
      "duration": "P30M",
      "title": "Drupal vs the rest",
      "location": "Saturday",
      "link": "http://drupalsouth.net.nz/session/drupal-vs-the-rest",
      "track": [
        "Session"
      ],
      "speakers": [
        "Julian Carver"
      ],
      "full_description": "Having conducted multiple RFPs where Drupal was offered as a solution, Julian can offer some insight into how Drupal stacks up against competing offerings such as Silverstripe, Alfresco, Episerver and others. How credible is Drupal in the enterprise? What does it do well? What needs to improve?",
      "video_url": "",
      "sponsorIds": ""
    },
    {
      "startTime": "2008-10-31T22:00:00Z",
      "endTime": "2008-10-31T22:30:00Z",
      "duration": "P30M",
      "title": "Drupal and the Encyclopedia of Life - True Taxonomy",
      "location": "Saturday",
      "link": "http://drupalsouth.net.nz/session/something-about-drupal",
      "track": [
        "Session"
      ],
      "speakers": [
        "Dan dman"
      ],
      "full_description": "The Encyclopedia of Life is a fascinating project investing big money and brainpower into Drupal. It is, or will be, a catalog of every single organism on Earth, something like 3 to 7 million taxons. They are distributing branches of this global tree to registered scientists as their own Drupal subsite, each maintaining and sharing a clade of the web of life.",
      "video_url": "",
      "sponsorIds": ""
    },
    {
      "startTime": "2008-10-31T22:30:00Z",
      "endTime": "2008-10-31T23:00:00Z",
      "duration": "P30M",
      "title": "Drupal and CiviCRM for campaigns",
      "location": "Saturday",
      "link": "http://drupalsouth.net.nz/session/drupal-and-civicrm-for-campaigns",
      "track": [
        "Session"
      ],
      "speakers": [
        "Chris Burgess"
      ],
      "full_description": "Reach your audience with effective campaigns using Drupal and CiviCRM, based on experience with the NZ Greens and other advocacy organisations. The archived session page also notes it had not yet been allocated a slot at that capture date.",
      "video_url": "",
      "sponsorIds": ""
    },
    {
      "startTime": "2008-10-31T23:00:00Z",
